    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d646">

                <pb facs="1110" n="1050" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg1050"/>

                <head>Mr. Sullivan to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 50.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogota,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 1, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith the
                    message of President Santos Acosta to the Colombian congress. I hope that by the
                    next mail I will be able to send you the answer of this government to my note
                    demanding suitable indemnities in behalf of the families of Borchart and
                    Murdaugh, murdered at Carthagena, on the 1st of September last, as well as on
                    behalf of the two survivors of that barbarous outrage.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PETER J. SULLIVAN</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D.C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d646-a1.xml" xpointer="d646-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
